# Review regression (U22, B6). Before: the Tab menu over a confirm box said "Enter Confirm /
# ` Cancel" while the box said "Enter start · ` edit" (D6: ` goes back to the editor), two
# names for one key; the meeting start box's menu said "Enter Confirm" under "Enter start".
# Now: the rows say what the box says: Enter Start / Save as queued / Close, ` Back to edit with
# the draft behind the box, else Cancel (a queue item's, opened from the board); the start box
# Enter Start, ` Cancel, Opt+L Cancel and lock.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100 lang=zh
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 1500
press opt+1
press opt+s
type fix the refund webhook
press enter
wait 500
shot spawn  the spawn confirm: [Enter]start · [`]edit
press tab
wait 400
shot spawn-menu  its Tab menu: Enter Start, ` Back to edit, Fn+` Back to edit
press down
wait 200
press enter
wait 400
shot back  the ` row: back in the editor, the text kept
press `
wait 500
press enter
wait 300
press opt+h
wait 300
press opt+r
wait 200
press tab
wait 400
shot start-menu  the meeting start box's menu: Enter Start, ` Cancel, Opt+L Cancel and lock
press tab
wait 300
press `
wait 300
usb off
wait 1500
press opt+1
press opt+s
type tidy the logs
press enter
wait 500
shot queued  offline: Offline: Mac queue only, [Enter]save as queued · [`]edit
press tab
wait 400
shot queued-menu  its Tab menu: Enter Save as queued, ` Back to edit, Fn+` Back to edit
